msgid "=== \"Prebuilt image\""
msgstr "=== \"预构建镜像\""

msgid ""
"The host needs only a working Ascend driver and firmware, plus Docker. The "
"image includes the CANN user-space environment, PyTorch/TorchNPU, vLLM, and "
"vLLM Ascend."
msgstr ""
"主机只需具备可用的 Ascend 驱动和固件，以及 Docker。镜像包含 CANN 用户空间环境、PyTorch/TorchNPU、vLLM 和 "
"vLLM Ascend。"

msgid "<span id=\"installation-prebuilt-image\"></span>"
msgstr "<span id=\"installation-prebuilt-image\"></span>"

msgid "Run the command for your hardware and operating system:"
msgstr "运行适用于您的硬件和操作系统的命令："

msgid "=== \"A2\""
msgstr "=== \"A2\""

msgid "=== \"Ubuntu\""
msgstr "=== \"Ubuntu\""

msgid "=== \"openEuler\""
msgstr "=== \"openEuler\""

msgid "=== \"A3\""
msgstr "=== \"A3\""

msgid "=== \"Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro\""

msgid "=== \"950DT\""
msgstr "=== \"950DT\""

msgid ""
"Choose an official image for the fastest setup, or build an image manually "
"when you need to customize it."
msgstr "如需快速完成部署，请选择官方镜像；如需自定义镜像，请手动构建。"

msgid "=== \"Select an official image\""
msgstr "=== \"选择官方镜像\""

msgid "<span id=\"installation-prebuilt-image-selection\"></span>"
msgstr "<span id=\"installation-prebuilt-image-selection\"></span>"

msgid "=== \"Build an image manually\""
msgstr "=== \"手动构建镜像\""

msgid "<span id=\"installation-prebuilt-image-build\"></span>"
msgstr "<span id=\"installation-prebuilt-image-build\"></span>"

msgid ""
"Select your hardware and operating system, then pull the official image, "
"start the container, and verify the environment."
msgstr "选择您的硬件和操作系统，然后拉取官方镜像、启动容器并验证环境。"

